<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Fixes several spec URLs.</p>
<p dir="auto">Accounts for:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Features removed from the spec (implies setting <code class="notranslate">deprecated: true</code>).</li>
<li>Features moved within a spec (i.e. different id).</li>
<li>Features moved to another spec.</li>
<li>Feature sections renamed.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Changes some spec URLs to draft, because webref/ed does not contain ids from TRs.</p>
